     <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHL-R1: Number of people having access to basic, safe and dignified shelters solutions</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basic, safe and dignified: 
- affected individuals have an minimum covered floor area of 3.5m2 per person.  
- all shelter solutions and materials meet locally agreed technical and performance standards and are culturally acceptable. 
- all household (re-)construction is in accordance with safe building practices and standards.
- all household (re-)construction demonstrate involvement of the affected population and/or are culturally acceptable by the affected population.</narrative>
    </description>
